==Rules==
{{ColosseumRule|Trust Fund}}

==Battleground==
*1 [[Galactic Overseer Nyandam]] spawns as the boss after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*1 [[Bun Bun Symbiote]] spawns after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*1 [[Bore]] spawns after 133.33 seconds<sup>4,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Evidently, the lack of peons means heavy hitters and strong CC'ers will be useful. Thus, [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]], [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman Cat]], [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]], [[Apple Cat (Super Rare Cat)|iCat]], [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Seafarer Cat]], and [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Slime Cat]] are all great options.
Other good additions are [[Stone Cat (Rare Cat)|Rock Cat]], [[Sushi Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Roe Cat]], [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]], [[Rover Cat (Rare Cat)|Catellite]], and [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]].

Since Nyandam spawns first, you can attempt to rush him if you have royal guard cat and soap cat, just be sure to bring research combos, once nyandam dies soap can hold bun bun behind the base. Bun Bun, dealing 35k damage per hit, will have a devastating wave attack. Ensure you have [[Immune to Waves|wave immune]] units or [[Wave Shield|wave blockers]]. Since Bore spawns after 2 minutes, damage the Bun Bun as much as you can and hope that the final struggle results in him defeated, leaving a relatively straightforward cleanup.

